      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">You will receive a refund of tuition if you drop a course officially in the Office of the Registrar by July 15, 2020. College fees are NOT refundable. A thirty percent refund is given for a withdrawal from July 20, 2020 to July 25, 2020, and no refund is given for a withdrawal after July 25, 2020. Students registered in any course canceled by the institution will be entitled to a full refund of tuition and fees. A fee of $20 will be assessed for any check returned by the bank on which it is drawn.</p>
