      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">To register, log into <span data-field="link_registration_adddrop_vii">{{ link_registration_adddrop_vii }}</span>, account, click Registration and select "Summer Course Registration Form".</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h4 style="font-weight: bold;">WITHDRAWAL</h4>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">To withdraw from a course, please log into <span data-field="link_withdrawal_vii">{{ link_withdrawal_vii }}</span>, account, click Registration and select "Summer Course Withdrawal Form".</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Withdrawals must be submitted on the official withdrawal form. The deadline for withdrawal from a course is July 15, 2020. No withdrawal will be granted after July 15, 2020.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h4 style="font-weight: bold;">REFUNDS</h4>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">You will receive a refund of tuition if you drop a course officially in the Office of the Registrar by July 15, 2020. College fees are NOT refundable. A thirty percent refund is given for a withdrawal from July 20, 2020 to July 25, 2020, and no refund is given for a withdrawal after July 25, 2020. Students registered in any course canceled by the institution will be entitled to a full refund of tuition and fees. A fee of $20 will be assessed for any check returned by the bank on which it is drawn.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

